# SPDX-License-Identifier: CeCILL-2.1 OR AGPL-3.0-or-later
# Self-contained Rust tree is populated by ./configure (N4IO_R_VENDOR=1) and the
# R-universe .prepare hook — never committed. The CRAN/R-universe source tarball
# bundles it (R CMD build runs after configure); a raw checkout regenerates it.
src/rust/vendored/
src/rust/vendor/
src/rust/vendor.tar.xz
src/rust/.cargo/
src/rust/Cargo.toml
src/rust/Cargo.lock
src/rust/target/
# Committed C ABI header is copied from the capi crate by ./configure.
src/nirs4all_io.h
# Compiled R artefacts (must never be committed; CRAN compiles from source).
src/*.o
src/*.so
src/*.dll
src/*.dylib
src/*.a
